    "type": "question",
    "label": "51",
    "prompt": "Complete the square of the following.\n$$5x^2+4x-2$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$5\\left(x+\\frac25\\right)^2-\\frac{14}{5}$\n\nFactor out $5$, complete the square, then multiply the balancing constant by $5$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5x^2+4x-2&=5\\left(x^2+\\frac45x-\\frac25\\right)\\\\5x^2+4x-2&=5\\left(\\left(x+\\frac25\\right)^2-\\frac4{25}-\\frac25\\right)\\\\5x^2+4x-2&=5\\left(\\left(x+\\frac25\\right)^2-\\frac{14}{25}\\right)\\\\5x^2+4x-2&=5\\left(x+\\frac25\\right)^2-\\frac{14}{5}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
